Cinema 4D (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from houdini (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-houdini\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-houdini-beta-2\">Publish from Houdini (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from solidworks (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-solidworks\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-solidworks-beta-2\">Publish from SolidWorks (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from spline, and figma (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-spline\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-spline-and-figma-beta-2\">Publish from Spline, and Figma (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"camera paths and default walkthroughs\" href=\"/docs/guides/camera-paths\" id=\"lnk-camera-paths-and-default-walkthroughs-2\">Camera paths and default walkthroughs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"hotspots and doors\" href=\"/docs/guides/hotspots-and-doors\" id=\"lnk-hotspots-and-doors-2\">Hotspots and doors</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse capture: film a room (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/film-a-room\" id=\"lnk-verse-capture-film-a-room-beta-2\">Verse Capture: film a room (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse play: host a web game\" href=\"/docs/guides/host-a-web-game\" id=\"lnk-verse-play-host-a-web-game-2\">Verse Play: host a web game</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"spatial bench\" href=\"/docs/guides/spatial-bench\" id=\"lnk-spatial-bench-2\">Spatial Bench</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"light and dark theme\" href=\"/docs/guides/light-and-dark-theme\" id=\"lnk-light-and-dark-theme-2\">Light and dark theme</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"share privately with tokens\" href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately\" id=\"lnk-share-privately-with-tokens-2\">Share privately with tokens</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"show your clients who looked\" href=\"/docs/guides/analytics\" id=\"lnk-show-your-clients-who-looked-2\">Show your clients who looked</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed anywhere: wordpress, shopify, webflow\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-wordpress-shopify-webflow-2\">Embed anywhere: WordPress, Shopify, Webflow</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse for commerce: 3d on product pages (woocommerce, magento, bigcommerce, salesforce)\" href=\"/docs/guides/commerce\" id=\"lnk-verse-for-commerce-3d-on-product-pages-w-2\">Verse for Commerce: 3D on product pages (WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce, Salesforce)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse links and embeds: embed the viewer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-the-viewer\" id=\"lnk-verse-links-and-embeds-embed-the-viewer-2\">Verse links and embeds: embed the viewer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"export a flythrough video\" href=\"/docs/guides/export-video\" id=\"lnk-export-a-flythrough-video-2\">Export a flythrough video</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"collect client review comments\" href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-collect-client-review-comments-2\">Collect client review comments</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"author a guided tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/author-a-guided-tour\" id=\"lnk-author-a-guided-tour-2\">Author a guided tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"video on surfaces, sound in the room\" href=\"/docs/guides/video-and-audio\" id=\"lnk-video-on-surfaces-sound-in-the-room-2\">Video on surfaces, sound in the room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from ifc or usd\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc-or-usd-2\">Publish from IFC or USD</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"upload fbx and obj\" href=\"/docs/guides/upload-fbx-obj\" id=\"lnk-upload-fbx-and-obj-2\">Upload FBX and OBJ</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"build a configurator\" href=\"/docs/guides/build-a-configurator\" id=\"lnk-build-a-configurator-2\">Build a configurator</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"present a scene to a room\" href=\"/docs/guides/present-a-scene\" id=\"lnk-present-a-scene-to-a-room-2\">Present a scene to a room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse-prepare: the local compression step\" href=\"/docs/guides/verse-prepare\" id=\"lnk-verse-prepare-the-local-compression-step-2\">verse-prepare: the local compression step</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"tune quality knobs\" href=\"/docs/guides/tune-quality\" id=\"lnk-tune-quality-knobs-2\">Tune quality knobs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"run your own server\" href=\"/docs/guides/run-your-own-server\" id=\"lnk-run-your-own-server-2\">Run your own server</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"monitor production\" href=\"/docs/guides/monitor-production\" id=\"lnk-monitor-production-2\">Monitor production</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"ask verse, the site assistant\" href=\"/docs/guides/ask-verse\" aria-current=\"page\" id=\"lnk-ask-verse-the-site-assistant-2\">Ask Verse, the site assistant</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: floor plan to 3d home\" href=\"/docs/guides/floor-plan-to-3d\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-floor-plan-to-3d-home-2\">Verse Home: floor plan to 3D home</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/instant-home\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-plan-to-a-home-buyers-walk-re-2\">Verse Home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page\" href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-one-tag-any-page-2\">&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"designer tools: framer, webflow, figma\" href=\"/docs/guides/designer-tools\" id=\"lnk-designer-tools-framer-webflow-figma-2\">Designer tools: Framer, Webflow, Figma</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"react and vue wrappers\" href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue-wrappers-2\">React and Vue wrappers</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"rest client round trip\" href=\"/docs/guides/rest-client\" id=\"lnk-rest-client-round-trip-2\">REST client round trip</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with woocommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-woocommerce-2\">Sell with WooCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with bigcommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-bigcommerce-2\">Sell with BigCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with magento / adobe commerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-2\">Sell with Magento / Adobe Commerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in wix\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-wix\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-wix-2\">Embed in Wix</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in squarespace\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-squarespace\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-squarespace-2\">Embed in Squarespace</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in framer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-framer\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-framer-2\">Embed in Framer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in ghost and hubspot\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-2\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with zapier\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-zapier\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-zapier-2\">Automate with Zapier</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with make\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-make\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-make-2\">Automate with Make</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with n8n\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-n8n\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-n8n-2\">Automate with n8n</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-10\"><h2>Blog & updates</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"all posts\" href=\"/docs/blog/index\" id=\"lnk-all-posts-2\">All posts</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"how verse streams a building\" href=\"/docs/blog/how-verse-streams-a-building\" id=\"lnk-how-verse-streams-a-building-2\">How Verse streams a building</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.7: what's new for you\" href=\"/docs/blog/verse-engine-2-7-whats-new\" id=\"lnk-2-7-what-s-new-for-you-2\">2.7: what's new for you</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.0 release notes for humans\" href=\"/docs/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" id=\"lnk-2-0-release-notes-for-humans-2\">2.0 release notes for humans</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-11\"><h2>Integrations</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"integrations: every platform at a glance\" href=\"/docs/integrations\" id=\"lnk-integrations-every-platform-at-a-glance-2\">Integrations: every platform at a glance</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-12\"><h2>API & SDK</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api, sdk and mcp: embed, sdk, webhooks\" href=\"/docs/developers\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-sdk-and-mcp-embed-sdk-webhooks-2\">Verse API, SDK and MCP: embed, SDK, webhooks</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api reference\" href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-reference-2\">Verse API reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api quickstart\" href=\"/docs/api-quickstart\" id=\"lnk-api-quickstart-2\">API quickstart</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api changelog\" href=\"/docs/api-changelog\" id=\"lnk-api-changelog-2\">API changelog</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed sdk reference\" href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-2\">Embed SDK reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse sdk: js / ts (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)\" href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-verse-sdk-js-ts-ctruhtech-verse-sdk-2\">Verse SDK: JS / TS (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse mcp server for ai agents\" href=\"/docs/mcp\" id=\"lnk-verse-mcp-server-for-ai-agents-2\">Verse MCP server for AI agents</a></section><p class=\"docs-no-results\" hidden>No matching guides.</p></div></nav></aside><div class=\"doc-body\"><article class=\"doc-article\" id=\"art-doc-article\"><h1 id=\"ask-verse-the-site-assistant\">Ask Verse, the site assistant<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ask-verse-the-site-assistant\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section\">#</a></h1>\n<p><strong>Ask Verse</strong> is the button at the bottom-right of the product page, the\napp, Studio and these docs. Type what you want in your own words — it\nanswers in a sentence or two and, where it can, does it for you by pressing\nthe page&#39;s own controls.</p>\n<p><strong>You need:</strong> nothing. It works on day one without any setup, in <em>basic</em>\nmode. An operator can switch on <em>AI</em> mode with one environment variable\n(see <a href=\"#operator-setup\" id=\"lnk-operator-setup\">Operator setup</a>).</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-you-can-ask\">What you can ask<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#what-you-can-ask\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-2\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Say something like</th><th>What happens</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>&quot;I want to show my apartment model to a client&quot;</td><td>Opens the app and the upload panel</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;How big can my file be?&quot;</td><td>Answers, and shows the current limits card</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;Open a demo scene&quot;</td><td>Loads one of the public demo scenes</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;Walk through this&quot; · &quot;Back to orbit&quot;</td><td>Switches walk mode on or off</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;Play the tour&quot; · &quot;Stop the tour&quot;</td><td>Plays or stops the scene&#39;s automatic camera tour</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;Make a video of this&quot;</td><td>Opens the <strong>Export video</strong> options</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;Share this scene&quot;</td><td>Shows the scene link and copies it</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;Collect comments on it&quot;</td><td>Turns on review mode</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;Make it private&quot;</td><td>Takes you to Studio and says which control to use</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;Embed this on my site&quot;</td><td>Opens the embed guide</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;Take me to the Blender exporter&quot;</td><td>Opens that guide</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;Show me around&quot;</td><td>Starts the guided tour of the page</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;How much does it cost?&quot;</td><td>Points you to hello@ctruh.com</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Each thing it does appears under the reply as a small chip (&quot;Switched to\nwalk mode&quot;), with <strong>Undo</strong> or <strong>Back</strong> where that makes sense. The\nconversation follows you when the assistant moves you to another page, and\nis forgotten when you close the tab.</p>\n<p>Keyboard: <strong>Enter</strong> sends, <strong>Shift+Enter</strong> adds a line, <strong>Esc</strong> closes the\npanel. On a phone the panel is a full-height sheet.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-it-cannot-do\">What it cannot do<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#what-it-cannot-do\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-3\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li>It cannot upload a file for you, sign in, or see or change your account,\ntokens or scenes. Making a scene private or revoking a link is done by\nyou, in <a href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately\" id=\"lnk-studio\">Studio</a>.</li><li>It only ever performs actions from a short fixed list (below), on this\nsite. It cannot open other websites.</li><li>It answers questions about using Verse Engine and nothing else.</li><li>Rendering quality has no in-page menu, so it cannot change it — it opens\n<a href=\"/docs/guides/tune-quality\" id=\"lnk-tune-quality-knobs-3\">Tune quality knobs</a> instead.</li></ul>\n<p>The complete list of actions:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Action</th><th>Does</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>navigate</code></td><td>Goes to <code>/</code>, <code>/app</code>, <code>/studio</code>, <code>/docs/</code> or a section of the product page</td></tr><tr><td><code>open_upload</code></td><td>Opens the upload panel / file picker in the app</td></tr><tr><td><code>load_demo</code></td><td>Opens a public demo scene</td></tr><tr><td><code>start_tour</code></td><td>Starts the guided product tour of a page</td></tr><tr><td><code>set_view</code></td><td>Walk, orbit, play or stop the scene tour, toggle the minimap or the measure tool</td></tr><tr><td><code>export_video</code></td><td>Opens the video export options</td></tr><tr><td><code>open_review</code></td><td>Turns on review mode</td></tr><tr><td><code>share_link</code></td><td>Shows and copies the scene link</td></tr><tr><td><code>open_docs</code></td><td>Opens a public documentation page</td></tr><tr><td><code>show_limits</code></td><td>Shows the upload limits</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Every action is checked against this list twice: by the server before it\nis sent, and by the page before it runs. Anything else is dropped.</p>\n<h2 id=\"basic-mode-and-ai-mode\">Basic mode and AI mode<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#basic-mode-and-ai-mode\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-4\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li><strong>Basic</strong> (the default): the server matches your request against a\ncurated set of common tasks and searches the headings of these docs.\nNothing leaves the server.</li><li><strong>AI</strong>: the server sends the conversation to Anthropic&#39;s Claude API and\nstreams the reply back. The model is given the public guides and the\ncurrent limits, and can only answer with text plus the actions above.</li></ul>\n<p>The small tag beside the panel title says which mode is on. If the AI\nservice is unreachable, that one reply falls back to basic mode.</p>\n<h2 id=\"privacy\">Privacy<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#privacy\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-5\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li>In AI mode, the messages you type (and which page you are on, and\nwhether a scene is loaded) are sent to <strong>Anthropic&#39;s API</strong> to generate\nthe reply. Do not type passwords or account tokens — the assistant never\nneeds them.</li><li><strong>Verse does not store your messages.</strong> The server logs one line per\nrequest with counts only (message count, characters, latency, token\nusage) — never the text. The conversation lives in your browser tab&#39;s\nsession storage and is gone when the tab closes.</li><li>In basic mode nothing is sent to any third party.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"turning-it-off\">Turning it off<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#turning-it-off\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-6\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Add <code>?assistant=0</code> to any page URL to hide the button. It never appears\ninside an embedded viewer (<code>embed.html</code>) or any iframe.</p>\n<h2 id=\"operator-setup\">Operator setup<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#operator-setup\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-7\">#</a></h2>\n<p>The assistant needs no configuration. To enable AI mode on a server you\nrun, set:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Variable</th><th>Default</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>ANTHROPIC_API_KEY</code></td><td>unset</td><td>Set it to switch on AI mode. Unset = basic mode.</td></tr><tr><td><code>VERSE_ASSIST_MODEL</code></td><td><code>claude-haiku-4-5</code></td><td>The Claude model. The default is the fast, inexpensive tier, which suits navigation help.</td></tr><tr><td><code>VERSE_ASSIST_DAILY_CAP</code></td><td><code>1000</code></td><td>Most AI requests answered per UTC day, across all visitors. Past it the endpoint answers <code>503</code> with a friendly message until the next day (or a restart).</td></tr><tr><td><code>VERSE_ASSIST_PER_HOUR</code></td><td><code>40</code></td><td>Messages per hour per IP address, both modes.</td></tr><tr><td><code>VERSE_ASSIST_MAX_TOKENS</code></td><td><code>700</code></td><td>Longest reply, in output tokens.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Other built-in limits: 20 messages per conversation, 1,000 characters per\nmessage, 3 actions per reply, a 25-second timeout, and at most 8 replies\nbeing written at once. <code>GET /v1/assist/status</code> reports the mode; the\nendpoint itself is documented in the <a href=\"/docs/api#post-v1-assist\" id=\"lnk-api-reference\">API reference</a>.</p>\n<p>Cost, as a rough guide: the product knowledge sent with every request is\ncached on Anthropic&#39;s side, so a typical exchange on the default model\ncosts a fraction of a US cent. The daily cap is the hard ceiling.</p></article><div class=\"doc-source\">Published documentation from <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/docs/#/guides/ask-verse\" id=\"lnk-verse-by-ctruh\">Verse by Ctruh</a></div></div><aside class=\"docs-toc\" id=\"asd-docs-toc\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#what-you-can-ask\" id=\"lnk-what-you-can-ask\">What you can ask</a><a href=\"#what-it-cannot-do\" id=\"lnk-what-it-cannot-do\">What it cannot do</a><a href=\"#basic-mode-and-ai-mode\" id=\"lnk-basic-mode-and-ai-mode\">Basic mode and AI mode</a><a href=\"#privacy\" id=\"lnk-privacy-2\">Privacy</a><a href=\"#turning-it-off\" id=\"lnk-turning-it-off\">Turning it off</a><a href=\"#operator-setup\" id=\"lnk-operator-setup-2\">Operator setup</a></aside></section>"}